    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "That sounds like fun! What is the theme?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-06T01:11:08.784980+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Yeah, that sounds like a great party! What are the themes for this party?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-06T01:11:41.788737+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh, that's really interesting! Are the themes related to music? I love listening to music and dancing.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-06T01:12:11.353103+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Yeah, I love the theme of music and dancing. It's so great that you're interested in attending a party with me tonight!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-06T01:13:22.515447+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "alex-reply-a010e87b3c1149688569853c15880a4d",
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 3,
      "to_name": "Alex",
      "content": "Sure, can you give me some suggestions?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-06T01:15:39.877494+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I'm glad to hear that! It will be great to see you at the party. Any particular songs or bands you'd like me to listen to?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-06T01:16:07.272130+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Wow, that's great to hear! It will be great to see you at the party. I hope we can share some good times together!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-06T01:17:34.073589+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Thank you for the update. I'm excited to hear more about your party!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-06T01:19:42.111305+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Oh, that's great to hear! I can't wait to hear more about your party!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-06T01:27:38.718491+00:00"
    },
    {
