      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I'm glad to hear that! What makes the party so great? Any particular bands or music genres you wanted me to listen to?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-06T01:34:18.091515+00:00"
    },
    {
